SIDE EFFECT 8: WEIGHT CHANGES

WHEN TO CALL YOUR DOCTOR
- Unable to eat for 24 hours
- Significant weight loss
- Severe nausea or vomiting
- Signs of dehydration
- Severe mouth sores preventing eating

